{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16232600","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16232600","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1623260001:0":{"text":"也许……你可以告诉我，怎样才能成为家畜？","source_cn":"也许……你可以告诉我，怎样才能成为家畜？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10736A4C8057A8F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1623260002:0":{"text":"我觉得家畜这份工作很不错，有吃有喝，还可以被主人一直照顾和关注着。","source_cn":"我觉得家畜这份工作很不错，有吃有喝，还可以被主人一直照...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE9908464791D38D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1623260003:0":{"text":"咩……家畜有什么好，大家最后只有那个结局，快逃……","source_cn":"咩……家畜有什么好，大家最后只有那个结局，快逃……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x544E8505AA24D7F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1623260004:1":{"text":"是什么结局……？完全不懂。","source_cn":"是什么结局……？完全不懂。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7701C22E59CBB2A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1623260005:1":{"text":"呼，要是坎德尔在就好了，他比我聪明多，一定可以理解羊先生的话。","source_cn":"呼，要是坎德尔在就好了，他比我聪明多，一定可以理解羊先...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1AC7E67E7E6C5EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"",